  "an6.99:0.3": "4. Dukkhasuttaṃ ",
  "an6.99:1.1": "‘‘So vata, bhikkhave, bhikkhu kañci saṅkhāraṃ sukhato samanupassanto…pe… ",
  "an6.99:1.2": "sabbasaṅkhāre dukkhato samanupassanto…pe… ",
  "an6.99:1.3": "ṭhānametaṃ vijjati’’. ",
  "an6.99:1.4": "Catutthaṃ. "
}
